// Variable - LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P677141013" "All {TaskForceName} die!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P4015076228" "Ah, {TaskForceName}! Dozens of thanks. Let me take a look at this lovely research. <br><br>Hmm...<br><br>Very interesting... <br><br>The monuments speak more about a deal between 'The People' and another great power, or powers. The Rularuu come up a great numer of times, in fact it appears that the people are at once told to worship and obey the Rularuu, but are also warned against worshipping them. Perhaps it means that the people were to worship a philosophy or religion or god, but not the creatures themselves. It also specifically mentions several powerful Rularuu. I can't make out many of the names, but three stand out, I've seen them before. This passage goes: <br><br>'And give over your strong to Ruladak that he may work them, <br>And give over your injuries to Faathim that he may heal them, <br>And give over your outcast to Lanaru that he may execute them, <br>For you will know that they are Rularuu and are to be obeyed.' <br><br>Well, that sounds quite ominous, doesn't it? I'll keep working, there's so much more here. Thanks again for all of your help, {TaskForceName}, you've really been quite fantastic."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2849787423" "Thanks for helping Dr. Boyd, {TaskForceName}. The information we've found already about Faathim has me worried about doing the tasks he asked about, but clearly something must have changed between whenever those monuments were written and now. In those monuments Faathim is called one of the Rularuu, but the monuments out here call him a traitor and the Rularuu are attacking him. The next task is really hard to translate, but I should have it for you shortly. I may have something else that we can do, first."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL9_TFA_Compound8 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2852009211" "I think I  have Faathim's next task translated, but I'll need to test out what I've learned of the language first. Best way to do that is on one of the monuments that I wasn't able to understand. So, are you ready to examine the monument over at the Bastion of Shame?"
// AcceptString :
"P777708406" "Travel to Bastion of Shame"
// SendOffString :
"P3996429190" "Back to the old pattern, right? First thing is to clear out some of the Rularuu, then get recordings of the monument for me. I'll see how much more I can translate this time, and that should tell us if I have this next task translated right or not."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL9_TFA_Compound8_Part1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2074069447" "Battle on Bastion of Shame"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3841788529" "You have defeated enough of the Rularuu around the Bastion of Shame"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL9_TFA_Compound8_Part2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P1606369021" "Visit Monument of Shame"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2868789241" "You have been to the Monument of Shame, and made records of it for Justin Augustine"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2111701249" "You always come through, you do. Let me get the photos from you, and I'll have a go at this.<br><br>I get this. Like Sanskrit, only backwards and written in a phonetic alphabet. Easy. <br><br>Okay, if I'm reading this one right, the gist of it is something like this: <br><br>'And by word and trickery the Traitor Faathim's work was done, <br>And the Mad One rose up with rage to split the world asunder, <br>And the Rularuu lost their truth and the People their master, <br>For Faathim's betrayal hid all from Rularuu's power.' <br><br>It's not too much clearer, but I do know that it's correct. I'll puzzle on it, but the important thing is I'm now pretty sure I translated Faathim's next task correctly."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL9_TFA_Mission9 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1052181116" "Alright, {TaskForceName}, here's what I've got. Faathim has given us some information about some 'Interlopers who wish only harm to the people of the Shadow Shard'. He's got some places these 'interlopers' can be found marked out. I'm still not sure what game he's playing, but it's a good bet that it should be checked out."
// AcceptString :
"P3610431142" "Check out Faathim's 'Interlopers'"
// SendOffString :
"P86218564" "I've marked the point for you, it's in the Cascades. Don't know how Faathim knows about it, but he may be showing that his awareness stretches beyond his walls. Defeat whatever you find in there. Finding out who these 'Interlopers' are could be very important. Somehow I don't think an entity like Faathim is going to give out tasks like this for no reason."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P3375465586" "Defeat all 'Interlopers'"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1795061499" "You'll need to defeat all of these 'Interlopers', then come talk to me."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P4189323304" "You feel a dark chill, as if something tenous as a spirit was rushing past you."

