"P263982110" "I'm still in mid-translation with the next task of Faathim's list, so while I'm finishing that, it might be a really good time to check out the next monument, over on the Bastion of Sorrow."
// AcceptString :
"P1179555431" "Travel to Bastion of Sorrow"
// SendOffString :
"P1742387646" "The old pattern has worked well so far, no reason to stop now, eh? First thing is to clear out some of the Rularuu around the Bastion of Sorrow, then get recordings of the monument for me. I should be able to finish the translation easy this time."

