"P1490579494" "You have been to the Monument of Sorrow, and made records of it for Justin Augustine"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3465990240" "Superb work, as always. Let me see...<br><br>'And Kindness and Strength shook the the world with battle, <br>And by clever stratagem Strength was caught and bound, <br>And Kindness was trapped as well within its fortress, <br>While Madness burned with rage and battled all.' <br><br>I think I'm starting to understand this saga. Let me think on it. In the meantime, I think that the next of Faathim's tasks may be a bit urgent."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL9_TFA_Mission11 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2814122884" "Faathim's next task is on the Bastion of Guilt. It talks about fighting the 'Interlopers', who I'm assuming are going to be the Circle of Thorns. It also warns about 'Harm done to innocents', and if the Circle's involved, that's never far behind."
// AcceptString :
"P153227457" "Investigate the Circle's activities on the Bastion of Guilt"
// SendOffString :
"P114998683" "I'm really worried about that 'Harm done to innocents' warning. Concentrate on that, rescuing any captives there. You can defeat any Circle types you find, of course, but concentrate on getting people out of there safe. <br><br>Faathim's been straight so far, just all cryptic. Entities like him, that's how they work. But if people are getting hurt while he waits for us to puzzle it out, then I'm not going to be pleased. "
// ActiveTaskString :
"P3137540300" "Save innocents from harm"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3682820201" "I'm really worried about that 'Harm done to innocents' warning. Concentrate on that, rescuing any captives there. You can defeat any Circle types you find, of course, but concentrate on getting people out of there safe. "

