"P3877822653" "You rescued the native captives from the Circle of Thorns"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2080928664" "The Circle has a lot of sick uses for people, but something about all of this seems strange. Why is Faathim interested in them? What are the Circle up to, and what do they need natives for? We don't even know how the Circle's gotten out here. It's almost time to get some answers out of Faathim the Kind, but there's one more piece of the puzzle we should get first."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL9_TFA_Compound12 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P733731679" "There's one last monument to translate. I think I know how this story ends, but if there's a twist, it could change how we have to handle Faathim and his tasks. So, let's get this one done."
// AcceptString :
"P3474485330" "Travel to Bastion of Regret"
// SendOffString :
"P117647846" "This is the last one, so let's get it over and done with. Just like the others, clear out some of the Rularuu around the Bastion of Regret, then get recordings of the monument for me. Translating should be easy, it's how this story ends that has me worried."

