// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P51197934" "Faathim's information points towards the Bastion of Pain. Looks like another coven of the Circle of Thorns. With some luck, we may even be able to find out what they're planning."
// AcceptString :
"P649299729" "Investigate the Circle's activities on the Bastion of Pain"
// SendOffString :
"P1237525769" "Your goal is to uncover the Circle's plans, and try to keep anyone from getting hurt by them. Faathim's been pointing towards this for some time, and entities like that don't do things on a whim."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P194798909" "Discover Circle plans"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P107982290" "Your main goal is to find some hint of the Circle's real plans, but if there are more people being held captive, you'll need to get them out of there, too."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P2431898071" "You can feel the energies of the Circle of Thorns' dark magic flowing all around."

