// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ModelDisplayName :
"P1778979957" "Books"
// Description :
"P3097314166" "Find Information"
// InteractBeginString :
"P3802658198" "You begin searching the bookshelf"
// InteractCompleteString :
"P2979148770" "You finish searching the bookshelf"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3571103378" "You found a book detailing the Circle's plans!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1788749613" "Though you defeated the Circle's defenders, you found that they had already sent attackers ahead to capture and bind Faathim the Kind."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P781704338" "I'm struck dumb. Everything else fits, but it's just so crazy. The idea of binding and capturing something like Faathim, it's mad. But they're talking like they've done it before. Doesn't matter, I guess. Now we just have to figure out how to stop them. No matter what any of us think of Faathim, we can't let the circle gain control of his power."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SF9_TFA_Compound16 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1294742397" "Faathim's in trouble, or he will be very soon. The Circle of Thorns are coming in to capture him and bind his power to their will. That's pretty much a chart-topper as far as bad things go. Things look bad, but it's not over yet. <br>Faathim's last task, you see. It changed. Right in front of my eyes. And it showed me where there's a secret way into the Chantry."
// AcceptString :
"P2443962425" "Enter the Chantry and defend Faathim from the Circle of Thorns"
// SendOffString :
"P1860945524" "This is the big ending battle, {TaskForceName}. If Faathim falls to the Circle, it could be the end of Paragon City and the world at large. You'll have to free Faathim from whatever the Circle's done to him, and defeat every member of the Circle of Thorns in there in order to win this battle. Good luck."

