// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SF9_TFA_Compound16_Part2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P635822506" "Re-enter Chantry, meet Faathim"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1403294400" "Faathim will no doubt wish to speak with you. Enter the Chantry through the normal entrance and speak with him again."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1742943720" "I am Faathim, called Faathim the Kind. I owe you all great thanks, heroes of {TaskForceName}. You had little reason, but you gave your trust to me, and for that I am in your debt. I have not experienced such... faith since I was inducted into Rularuu. <br><br>I have re-formed myself, and purged any damage from the battle. The Circle may try again, but I will not fear them. <br><br>As you have given trust to me, I too may place some trust in you. All that you have learned is true. I betrayed Rularuu, whom I was returned to life to serve. I caused the Shadow Shard to be broken, but it was to create a place free of Rularuu, where the natives I had gathered could live in peace and one day welcome their brothers from your world. It was not to be, but at least you found us. Now, though my brother-selves still work against us, and Rularuu waits to re-open the way and return, I have hope. For I have seen the true nature of heroes, and I know they are in the Shadow Shard once more."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2681140201" "Well, that's it then, isn't it? You did more than I thought would ever be needed, {TaskForceName}. You lot were solid sterling, you were. Not only did we save the world and defeat the Circle of Thorns, I'm sure to get at least tenure at the school of my choice out of all of this. Might make a nice change."
// RandomFameString :
"P3118782319" "Hey, {HeroName}! I heard that you rescued a god or something. What's up with that?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// RandomFameString :
"P829926988" "I've heard strange rumors that a group called {TaskForceName} saved some kind of powerful alien entity out in the Shadow Shard."
